   "he": "וּפִיו דּוֹמֶה כְּשֶׁל חֲזִיר. אָמַר רַב פָּפָּא: לָא תֵּימָא דִּשְׁפִיד וּפְרִוס, אֶלָּא כֵּיוָן דִּפְרִוס אַף עַל גַּב דְּלָא שְׁפִיד.",
   "en": "The mishna teaches: «Or its mouth is similar to» that «of a pig. Rav Pappa says: Do not say» that this is referring only to a case «where» the mouth is «pointed and» the upper lip «overlaps» the bottom lip, exactly like that of a pig. «Rather, when it overlaps, even though it is not pointed,» this is a blemish."
  }
